      "sourceText": "Example: Zeke uses a Vitality Juice Box on Nightingale. This Item allows Nightingale to HEAL 3. Nightingale currently has 2 Damage tokens on her card. Nightingale's player would remove the 2 Damage tokens from her card, bringing her to full HP. The 1 point of unused healing is lost.",
